From: Flax Advisors <hmccanne@exclamationpoint.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fbtp: match the OEM fan failsafe and ramp rate

Decoding the OEM's own fan table off its firmware
(/mnt/oemroot/etc/defconfig/FanTable_TP_channel_V4_20201008.xml) showed our
config is otherwise a faithful copy of it -- same sensor, same curve, no inlet
correction -- but missing two of its damping mechanisms:

    FSC Domain Profile   CfgPwm   0x3C = 60%      <- failsafe
                         RampRate 0x14 = 20       <- slew limit
    FSC Stepwise 0x00    NegativeHysteresis 1     <- added already in 0023

Failsafe 100 -> 60.  Failsafe means "I cannot see temperatures", which on this
platform happens with the host powered off or during boot before PECI comes up.
Those are precisely the moments the machine is coldest and the CPUs are not
working, so commanding 100% buys nothing and is the "loud at boot / loud when
off" behaviour.  The OEM idles the same condition at 60%.

Slew limits on the fan controllers, -20/+20 (output units per second, applied
as lastOutput + slew*ts with ts = cycleIntervalTimeMS = 200 ms).  A 35% -> 70%
step now takes ~1.75 s instead of snapping, and full speed is still reachable in
under 5 s, which is far quicker than any thermal time constant here.  This is
the OEM's RampRate, and it is a second, independent brake on oscillation:
hysteresis stops the controller changing its mind, slew stops the fans slamming
when it does.

Deliberately NOT touched: the DTS_CPU*_Pid thermal controllers keep SlewNeg -1
and SlewPos 0.0.  Zero on the positive side means no limit on ramping UP, so a
CPU heating still gets an immediate fan response; only the fan channel output is
rate limited.  Rate limiting the thermal controllers' rise would delay cooling a
hot CPU, which is the one thing this must not do.

Signed-off-by: Flax <hmccanne@exclamationpoint.com>
---
 configurations/fbtp.json | 10 +++++-----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/configurations/fbtp.json b/configurations/fbtp.json
index d75b1b0..3c7f64f 100644
--- a/configurations/fbtp.json
+++ b/configurations/fbtp.json
@@ -470,8 +470,8 @@
         "Pwm 1"
       ],
       "PCoefficient": 0.0,
-      "SlewNeg": 0.0,
-      "SlewPos": 0.0,
+      "SlewNeg": -20.0,
+      "SlewPos": 20.0,
       "Type": "Pid",
       "Zones": [
         "Left"
@@ -494,8 +494,8 @@
         "Pwm 2"
       ],
       "PCoefficient": 0.0,
-      "SlewNeg": 0.0,
-      "SlewPos": 0.0,
+      "SlewNeg": -20.0,
+      "SlewPos": 20.0,
       "Type": "Pid",
       "Zones": [
         "Left"
@@ -548,7 +548,7 @@
       ]
     },
     {
-      "FailSafePercent": 100,
+      "FailSafePercent": 60,
       "MinThermalOutput": 10,
       "Name": "Left",
       "Type": "Pid.Zone"
-- 
2.34.1

